      "content": "it's weird you say that. because when i think about that \"absolute quiet\" you're talking about... it's the only time i actually feel like i can breathe. it feels like the only way to actually be free of all these hands pulling at me. like, is it really so wrong to just want to find a way out of this? to just... be done?",
